{"2661300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grounded 2", "steam_appid": 2661300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3784940, 3788090], "detailed_description": "<h1>Game Editions</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/cc23ab9eb55ba33c66a84513757f4ca9.avif?t=1787010637\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras_big/cc23ab9eb55ba33c66a84513757f4ca9.webp?t=1787010637 width=1560 height=1098 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/21efe3b37cde6b65948de561fbfeb6fb.avif?t=1787010637\" width=1560 height=787 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you've been shrunk to the size of an ant, what was once familiar is now a wild, uncharted frontier. Traverse sprawling manmade spaces overgrown with nature with buggies that can fight alongside with you, uncover hidden secrets, and fight to survive in a world much larger than the backyard. The playground may seem familiar, but beneath its bright colors and towering structures lie mysteries hidden in plain sight. Are you ready to uncover them?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/6e31f40564e56e76b50be584a070ea27.poster.avif?t=1787010637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/6e31f40564e56e76b50be584a070ea27.webm?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/6e31f40564e56e76b50be584a070ea27.mp4?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Survive, Adapt, Overcome</u></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is relentless, but so are you. Shape your adventure with unique archetypes, each offering distinct abilities to match your playstyle. Whether you rely on precision, cunning, or sheer strength, you’ll need every advantage to survive against the threats lurking in the park.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/9533d85f4dd859368eb85035edd1621e.poster.avif?t=1787010637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/9533d85f4dd859368eb85035edd1621e.webm?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/9533d85f4dd859368eb85035edd1621e.mp4?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Stronger Together</u></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perils of the park are daunting alone, but with friends, every challenge becomes an adventure. Work together to build, fight, and uncover the secrets buried beneath the grass. Whether you’re facing danger side by side or continuing your journey in a shared world, survival is always better with allies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/db7e8924376678212b5d10283a4f610d.poster.avif?t=1787010637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/db7e8924376678212b5d10283a4f610d.webm?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/db7e8924376678212b5d10283a4f610d.mp4?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Walking is Bogus - Introducing Buggies</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They scurry, they fight, and now—they help you survive. Hatch, raise, and ride your own insect friends - buggies! Saddle up and ride through the park, command them in battle, or have them help gather resources. The right partner could mean the difference between thriving and barely surviving.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/f22b1c36ff7c1072270350f8faed2ff2.poster.avif?t=1787010637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/f22b1c36ff7c1072270350f8faed2ff2.webm?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/f22b1c36ff7c1072270350f8faed2ff2.mp4?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Big Baddies of the Park</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The park is home to creatures other than the bugs you know and love. AXL, the tarantula, and the Lizard stand as apex predators that demand preparation, strategy, and courage. The snake is a different kind of challenge. To master it, you will need to learn its patterns, ride it, and harvest its scales. And let's not forget about the bird. Every encounter makes you stronger. Claim rare materials, craft powerful gear, and unlock upgrades that push you further into a world built to overwhelm you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/aa752c57c7558c2b9f2252964bb6d0a1.poster.avif?t=1787010637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/aa752c57c7558c2b9f2252964bb6d0a1.webm?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/aa752c57c7558c2b9f2252964bb6d0a1.mp4?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Playgrounds</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is only the beginning. With Playgrounds, you can build your own challenges using powerful tools that shape combat, puzzles, and unpredictable encounters. Download, play, and vote on community creations to discover new ways to test your skills. The park is no longer just a place to survive. It is a place to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/1ab1df4937cb3dbf7379dc310b5acfd4.poster.avif?t=1787010637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/1ab1df4937cb3dbf7379dc310b5acfd4.webm?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/1ab1df4937cb3dbf7379dc310b5acfd4.mp4?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Home Sweet Home</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The park is yours to claim. Build everything from simple shelters to sprawling fortresses that keep you safe from the dangers outside. But don't limit yourself to just dry land. Create fully underwater bases to support long expeditions, expand your reach into the depths, and make every corner of the park a cozy little home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/0e0af5bff5d6486960c182c0ea4ae9c7.poster.avif?t=1787010637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/0e0af5bff5d6486960c182c0ea4ae9c7.webm?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661300/extras/0e0af5bff5d6486960c182c0ea4ae9c7.mp4?t=1787010637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A Shadow That Follows You</u></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threat is always there—watching, learning, waiting. You don’t know where it’s coming from, only that it never leaves. The deeper you dig, the closer it gets. Some mysteries should stay buried, but it’s too late now. It knows you’re looking. And it’s ready. Every answer drags you deeper, every step invites something closer. You were never alone. You thought you were in control. You were wrong.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you've been shrunk to the size of an ant, what was once familiar is now a wild, uncharted frontier. Traverse sprawling manmade spaces overgrown with nature with buggies that can fight alongside with you, uncover hidden secrets, and fight to survive in a world much larger than the backyard. The playground may seem familiar, but beneath its bright colors and towering structures lie mysteries hidden in plain sight. Are you ready to uncover them?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli